findings.recommendation:
Fix the argument order in transferPlots to match the helper signature decrementAllowancePods(owner, spender, fieldId, amount):

    decrementAllowancePods(sender, LibTractor._user(), fieldId, totalAmount);

Additionally, move the allowance check to BEFORE _transferPlots so an insufficient/invalid allowance reverts before any plot is moved, matching the intent of transferPlot. Consider adding a compile-time guard by giving allowance helpers named-struct parameters or asserting the decrement actually reduced a non-zero allowance.
